(card "exp:G-R1-3_cross_source_consensus_strict" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:G-R1-3_cross_source_consensus_strict"
  :body "---\nnav: 30\ntype: experiment\nid: G-R1-3_cross_source_consensus_strict\nshort_name: cross_source_consensus_strict\ntitle: \"G-R1-3 — cross-source consensus, strict past-60min half-open\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: g\nround: r1\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_g__source_swap]]\"\ntrain_nav: 1.0350\ntrain_trade_count: 27\ntrain_win_rate: 0.6667\ntrain_sharpe: 2.8498\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0096\nval_nav_mean: 1.0020\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0056\nval_window_count: 8\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: demoted\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 1\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [cross_source, source_swap]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/g, round/r1, axis/cross_source, axis/source_swap, status/demoted, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/small]\n---\n\n# G-R1-3 — cross-source consensus (strict past-60min)\n\n> **TL;DR** —— G-R1-3 尝试用 **cross-source consensus**: 只在 confirming (2nd) leader 时刻 emit，past 60min half-open window。train 27 trade / NAV 1.04 / sharpe 2.85 —— sample 太稀。但**这是 Team G 真正的设计方向** —— G-R1-1/G-R1-2 单 source swap 都 fail，consensus 是替代。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：cross-source confirmation = 多个 leader 在 past 60min 同方向 signal → 真正高置信度 trade。\n- 实测：confirming signal 在 anchor pool 上太稀, 27 trade 太少, statistical noise dominate。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`team_g/scripts/round_1_runner.py`\n- 使用 `output/round_1/consensus_strict.csv` 作 signal source。\n- strict past-only [t-60min, t) window for confirming-leader detection.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- past-60min 半开窗口 strict past-only. `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 1.0350 | 27 | 2.85 | 66.7% | -0.96% |\n| Val (8w only) | 1.0020 ± 0.006 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN | - | - | - | - |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 1; sample 稀。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n- **alt_to**: [[arc_260516a__team_g__G-R1-1__luoyangchan_solo]], [[arc_260516a__team_g__G-R1-2__yingli_solo]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `team_g/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (G-R1-3)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- **真正值得继续探的 lineage**: cross-source consensus 在数据多的环境（≥1000 trade/月）大概率 productive，但 arc 260516a 的 trade pool 太小。\n- 下次 arc 应：(1) 用 90d+ train window 累计 raw consensus signal，(2) 设计 anchor + consensus blend（不是完全替换 source），保证 trade_count ≥ 100。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_g__G-R1-3__cross_source_consensus_strict.md"
  :source_mtime "2026-05-17T10:29:56+08:00"
